WEBVTT

00:00:13.656 --> 00:00:15.064
This is the payments portal for the

00:00:15.107 --> 00:00:17.496
orchestrator, Unicity's in-house payment service.

00:00:18.221 --> 00:00:19.373
The Payments team runs it here,

00:00:19.715 --> 00:00:20.415
without a developer.

00:00:20.952 --> 00:00:22.787
Nine pages, and three jobs:

00:00:23.213 --> 00:00:24.920
connect, route, and see.

00:00:26.807 --> 00:00:27.507
Job one:

00:00:27.746 --> 00:00:28.446
connect.

00:00:28.556 --> 00:00:30.519
Processors is where Payments connects our

00:00:30.562 --> 00:00:31.262
merchant accounts.

00:00:31.543 --> 00:00:32.567
Six are connected today,

00:00:33.079 --> 00:00:35.938
across Worldpay, Nuvei, Braintree for

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:37.644
PayPal, and Network Merchants,

00:00:37.943 --> 00:00:39.863
each one tested and switched on here.

00:00:41.153 --> 00:00:43.286
Checkout previews the payment form exactly

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.396
as a shopper sees it:

00:00:44.865 --> 00:00:45.974
that market's ways to pay,

00:00:46.358 --> 00:00:47.681
and its own address layout,

00:00:47.852 --> 00:00:49.345
at desktop or mobile size.

00:00:50.855 --> 00:00:52.860
Settings holds the keys our servers use.

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:55.761
Rotate one, and the old key keeps working

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:58.151
for twenty-four hours, so checkout never breaks.

00:00:59.717 --> 00:01:01.679
And Team shows everyone who can sign in.

00:01:01.978 --> 00:01:04.111
An admin invites a teammate by link,

00:01:04.453 --> 00:01:05.861
and everyone has their own login,

00:01:06.159 --> 00:01:07.525
so every change carries a name.

00:01:09.458 --> 00:01:10.158
Job two:

00:01:10.397 --> 00:01:11.017
route.

00:01:11.037 --> 00:01:13.341
Routing decides which processor account

00:01:13.426 --> 00:01:14.450
charges each payment.

00:01:15.579 --> 00:01:16.901
Here is rule one for Canada:

00:01:17.328 --> 00:01:19.077
paid by card, in Canadian dollars.

00:01:20.387 --> 00:01:22.734
It sends eighty of every hundred payments

00:01:22.862 --> 00:01:25.507
to the Nuvei account, and twenty to Worldpay.

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:28.136
If the first account cannot take a

00:01:28.179 --> 00:01:29.416
payment, the next one tries.

00:01:30.141 --> 00:01:32.019
Anything no rule matches goes to the

00:01:32.061 --> 00:01:32.761
fallback account.

00:01:33.866 --> 00:01:35.146
And before a rule is published,

00:01:35.488 --> 00:01:37.536
a dry run shows where a payment would land.

00:01:38.261 --> 00:01:39.498
Forty-three tried so far,

00:01:39.925 --> 00:01:41.930
and all forty-three went where the rules said.

00:01:43.821 --> 00:01:44.521
Job three:

00:01:44.802 --> 00:01:45.502
see.

00:01:45.784 --> 00:01:47.405
Payments shows every payment.

00:01:47.746 --> 00:01:49.794
Open one, and every attempt is there:

00:01:50.178 --> 00:01:51.288
the processor that took it,

00:01:51.458 --> 00:01:52.158
and how it ended.

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:54.360
This one was paid on its third attempt.

00:01:55.876 --> 00:01:58.222
Orders shows that same payment under our

00:01:58.265 --> 00:01:59.246
own order reference.

00:02:00.818 --> 00:02:02.865
Webhooks are the signed messages that tell

00:02:02.908 --> 00:02:03.762
our systems what happened.

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:05.682
Here is the one for that payment:

00:02:06.108 --> 00:02:08.284
delivered, with the reply exactly as

00:02:08.327 --> 00:02:09.948
received, and it can be sent again.

00:02:11.332 --> 00:02:12.825
And the Dashboard adds it all up:

00:02:13.038 --> 00:02:15.172
eleven figures, each compared with the

00:02:15.214 --> 00:02:15.914
period before.

00:02:16.409 --> 00:02:18.372
One of them counts payments that succeeded

00:02:18.457 --> 00:02:20.377
after a decline, like the one we just followed.

00:02:22.097 --> 00:02:23.590
That is the payments portal for the

00:02:23.633 --> 00:02:24.333
orchestrator today.

00:02:25.041 --> 00:02:26.364
Payments connects the accounts,

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:28.241
sets and tests the routing,

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:31.158
and sees every payment, in one place.

